OL,3,GNEWSAFrom punk to politics - the making
OL,4,Aof new Reform Wales leader Helen Jenner
OL,5,
OL,6,FHelen Jenner, the new leader of Reform
OL,7,FWales, got a taster session for the top
OL,8,Fjob on Tuesday, with a confident
OL,9,Fperformance quizzing Plaid Cymru First
OL,10,FMinister Rhun ap Iorwerth in the
OL,11,FSenedd.
OL,13,FThe Bangor Conwy Mon MS took over after
OL,14,Fher predecessor Dan Thomas quit as
OL,15,Fleader following an arrest on suspicion
OL,16,Fof assault and controlling or coercive
OL,17,Fbehaviour.
OL,19,FHe says he has done nothing wrong.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
